91)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">38.2&#x00025; (74&#x0002f;191)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0002b;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">61.5 (8&#x0002f;13)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02212;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">38.4 (5&#x0002f;13)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label/><p>hnRNP K&#x0003d;heterogeneous ribonucleoprotein K.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote2"><label/><p>The expression of p53 was compared to nuclear or cytoplasmic hnRNP K staining. Absence or presence of the protein is represented by a &#x02212; or &#x0002b;, respectively.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>